more, until about 10:00.

00:23:36.660 --> 00:23:39.055
Then a go to bed, sleep for around

00:23:39.055 --> 00:23:42.068
seven hours and do it all over again.

00:23:42.068 --> 00:23:44.303
I know that from the outside, looking in,

00:23:44.303 --> 00:23:46.782
it might seem like I'm always working,

00:23:46.782 --> 00:23:48.695
but I don't feel like that.

00:23:48.695 --> 00:23:50.566
I feel, honestly, like I'm the luckiest

00:23:50.566 --> 00:23:51.710
guy in the world.

00:23:51.710 --> 00:23:53.453
This point in my life and my career,

00:23:53.453 --> 00:23:55.370
I still love what I do.

00:23:56.323 --> 00:23:57.846
And every single day I get up

00:23:57.846 --> 00:24:01.281
